  "description": "VecturaDB 1.0.0-preview.3.post1 as a .NET tool: the command vecturadb runs the VecturaDB server and CLI, without Python and without Docker. The first run downloads the executable of its platform from the GitHub release of VecturaDB, for Windows x64, Linux x64 and arm64 (glibc 2.17 and later), macOS x64 and arm64, and checks its SHA-256 hash. VecturaDB is an independent fork of Chroma, under the Apache License 2.0. The original code is copyright Chroma Inc. and its contributors. Not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Chroma Inc. CHROMA is a registered trademark of Chroma Inc., used here only to describe compatibility.",
